# Move the experts section out of index.html.slim.

section id="experts"
  .container
    header
      h2 Experts
      span.line
    .row
      .col-sm-6
        h3 Mobile Application Development
        p We build native iOS (Swift) and Android (Kotlin) apps, plus cross-platform React Native when the budget calls for it.
      .col-sm-6
        h3 Web Development
        p Ruby on Rails is our primary backend. We pair it with React or Hotwire on the front end, deployed to Heroku or AWS.
      .col-sm-6
        h3 UX/UI Design
        p Our designers wireframe in Figma, prototype in Framer, and hand off to engineering with a design system - not pixel-pushing.
      .col-sm-6
        h3 Database Architecture
        p We design schemas that scale: PostgreSQL with proper indexing, Redis for caching, and read replicas when the traffic warrants.
